                                "sense_id": "4b4b6eb2-4d8b-3b72-9788-fc6591bd13a2",
                                "text": "He deserted, and for the sake of a girl, a spiggoty girl?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be2e7149-c28d-4534-a6c0-c6122100dd19",
                                "sense_id": "4b4b6eb2-4d8b-3b72-9788-fc6591bd13a2",
                                "text": "You make the mistake of all Gringos in thinking a Mexican is a white man. He ain’t. None of them ain’t—Greasers, Spiggoties, Latin-Americans and all the rest of the cattle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cde35295-2703-455d-815b-106091c131c9",
                                "sense_id": "4b4b6eb2-4d8b-3b72-9788-fc6591bd13a2",
                                "text": "Before Lefty Bill could drop his hammer, the spiggoty had turned around, drawed and let drive."
